{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"gunnery_yard","model_identifier":"gunnery_yard","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# gunnery_yard\n\nGunnery yard: a stone-walled yard with an earth bank at the far end, wooden targets in front of it, and a cannon on a plank firing platform.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with a new look: a walled engine yard of warm stone with brick coping, brick corner towers and a raised gate. Inside: an open-fronted brick workshop with an iron-plate roof, forge hearth and a bronze cannon barrel on trestles; a half-built catapult in pale new timber; a post crane hoisting a gun; pyramids of iron and stone cannonballs; a powder magazine with a keg cart; and a firing range with targets on an earth bank. The firing platform is left empty for the game's cannon at slot_cannon.\n\n- Footprint: 14 x 14 columns (224 x 224 units, 6.30 x 6.30 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -113..113, y 0..103, z -116..113 units.\n- Texture: 1024 x 1024, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: finished 909, construction_0 144, construction_33 558, construction_66 718, ruined 652 (the state sets are cut from the finished cubes and map into the texture regions of the faces they were cut from).\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and footing with materials waiting, then walls rising inside scaffold).\n- `ruined`: broken walls at uneven heights, rubble and fallen beams.\n- `gunnery_yard_damaged.png`: damaged texture (cracks, scorch) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- yard wall ring: 216 x 46 x 216, 8 u thick, open inside\n- earth bank: 200 x 50 x 40 at z 80\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -116)\n- `slot_cannon` at (0, 6, -50)\n- `fx_smoke` at (-54, 104, 45.5)\n- `fx_window_1` at (-84, 28, 44)\n- `fx_window_2` at (-66, 28, 44)\n- `fx_window_3` at (-36, 28, 6)\n- `fx_window_4` at (-36, 28, 28)"},"resolution":{"width":1024,"height":1024},"elements":[{"name":"earth_yard#7a5a38","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-99.56,0.28,-100],"to":[99.44,0.9,99.78],"autouv":0,"color":2,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,0,1,1],"texture":null},"east":{"uv":[10,646,210,647],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,0,1,1],"texture":null},"west":{"uv":[210,646,410,647],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,199,200],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[199,0,398,200],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"82ca5fa2-a1ff-3016-8664-8400603ffb26"},{"name":"stone_road#a49c8c","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-15,0.8,-99.9],"to":[15,1.7,-30],"autouv":0,"color":7,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[880,649,910,650],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[399,648,469,649],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[910,649,940,650],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[469,648,539,649],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[650,0,680,70],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,0,1,1],"texture":null}},"type":"cube","uuid":"30dcc098-429a-4e78-5701-9e403b297349"},{"name":"stone_road#a49c8c_2","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-15,0.8,-115],"to":[15,1.6,-100.5],"autouv":0,"color":1,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[940,649,970,650],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[928,651,943,652],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[970,649,1000,650],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[943,651,958,652],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[187,448,217,463],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,0,1,1],"texture":null}},"type":"cube","uuid":"4